      "title": "Ship the checkout page?",
      "context": "Your manager shares an A/B test of a new checkout page. The old page converted 4.1% and the new one 4.6%, with 10,000 users in each group. The p-value is 0.08. She wants to ship today.",
      "figures": [
        {
          "value": "4.1%",
          "label": "Old page"
        },
        {
          "value": "4.6%",
          "label": "New page"
